<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">DEVELOPMENT CONNECTION</view><view class="serif setting-title">服务地址</view><view class="notice notice-copper"><text class="notice-title">本地调试说明</text>模拟器可尝试 127.0.0.1；真机上的 127.0.0.1 指向手机自身。真机需可达的服务器地址及相应平台配置。</view>
  <view class="section-head"><text class="section-title">API 地址</text></view><view class="card"><view class="field-label">输入服务地址</view><input class="input" value="{{address}}" placeholder="http://127.0.0.1:8766" placeholder-class="input-placeholder" bindinput="onInput"/><view class="setting-actions"><view class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" bindtap="onSave">保存地址</view><view class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" bindtap="onCheck">{{checking ? '检测中…' : '检测连接'}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{healthText}}" class="notice {{healthOk ? '' : 'notice-warn'}} setting-result">{{healthText}}</view></view>
  <view class="btn btn-ghost btn-block reset" bindtap="onReset">恢复默认本机地址</view><view class="footnote">本地试用版允许填写 HTTP 地址以便开发者工具调试。正式上线需要依微信平台要求配置合适的服务域名、网络安全与身份权限。</view>
</view>
